    "protected": false,
    "rendered": "<div class=\"xyz-content\">\n<nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"shell pt-6\">\n<ol class=\"m-0 flex list-none flex-wrap items-center gap-2 p-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">\n<li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"> <a href=\"/\" class=\"no-underline hover:underline\"> Home </a> </li>\n<li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"> <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-rule\"> / </span> <a href=\"/services/\" class=\"no-underline hover:underline\"> Services </a> </li>\n<li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"> <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-rule\"> / </span> <span aria-current=\"page\">BAS &#038; GST lodgement</span> </li>\n</ol>\n</nav>\n<div class=\"shell pt-6\">\n<p class=\"eyebrow m-0\">Services</p>\n<h1 class=\"mt-3 max-w-3xl text-3xl sm:text-4xl\">BAS &#038; GST lodgement</h1>\n<p class=\"mt-4 max-w-2xl text-[1.0625rem]\">Your business activity statement prepared from your books, checked by a registered agent and lodged on time — GST, PAYG withholding and PAYG instalments, without the quarterly scramble.</p>\n</p></div>\n<section class=\"shell mt-10\">\n<div class=\"grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3\">\n<div class=\"card p-5\">\n<p class=\"eyebrow m-0\">Our fee</p>\n<p class=\"mt-1 mb-0\"> <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums tracking-tight text-ink text-2xl font-medium\">$99</span> <span class=\"ml-2 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">a quarter, inc. GST</span> </p>\n<p class=\"mt-1 mb-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">Fixed per quarterly BAS from clean books, and included in every bookkeeping tier. Monthly BAS and catch-up quarters are quoted.</p>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"card p-5\">\n<p class=\"eyebrow m-0\">Government charges</p>\n<p class=\"mt-1 mb-0 text-[1.0625rem] font-semibold\">None</p>\n<p class=\"mt-1 mb-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">Lodging a BAS is free. What you owe the ATO on the BAS itself is paid to the ATO, not to us.</p>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"card p-5\">\n<p class=\"eyebrow m-0\">Turnaround</p>\n<p class=\"mt-1 mb-0 text-[1.0625rem] font-semibold\">Before the due date</p>\n<p class=\"mt-1 mb-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">Lodged through our agent portal, which can give extra time on quarterly BAS lodged online.</p>\n</p></div>\n</p></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"shell mt-16\">\n<div class=\"grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-[1.2fr_1fr]\">\n<div>\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl\">What&#8217;s included</h2>\n<ul class=\"mt-5 list-none border-t border-rule p-0\">\n<li class=\"border-b border-rule py-3 text-[0.9375rem]\">GST reconciled against your bookkeeping and bank feeds, not just copied out of the software</li>\n<li class=\"border-b border-rule py-3 text-[0.9375rem]\">PAYG withholding (W1 and W2) checked against payroll</li>\n<li class=\"border-b border-rule py-3 text-[0.9375rem]\">PAYG instalments, including whether a varied instalment would suit you</li>\n<li class=\"border-b border-rule py-3 text-[0.9375rem]\">Fuel tax credits where you are entitled to them</li>\n<li class=\"border-b border-rule py-3 text-[0.9375rem]\">The figure you owe and its due date, sent to you before lodgement</li>\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl\">How it runs</h2>\n<ol class=\"mt-5 list-none border-t border-rule p-0\">\n<li class=\"flex gap-4 border-b border-rule py-3\"> <span class=\"font-mono text-[0.75rem] tabular-nums text-ink-soft\"> 01 </span> <span class=\"text-[0.9375rem]\">Verify your identity online — about three minutes on your phone, included in the fee. Every client, every service, no exceptions. <a href=\"/identity-verification/\">How it works</a>.</span> </li>\n<li class=\"flex gap-4 border-b border-rule py-3\"> <span class=\"font-mono text-[0.75rem] tabular-nums text-ink-soft\"> 02 </span> <span class=\"text-[0.9375rem]\">Give us access to your Xero, MYOB or QuickBooks file, or upload your records to the portal.</span> </li>\n<li class=\"flex gap-4 border-b border-rule py-3\"> <span class=\"font-mono text-[0.75rem] tabular-nums text-ink-soft\"> 03 </span> <span class=\"text-[0.9375rem]\">We reconcile the quarter and flag anything that does not look right.</span> </li>\n<li class=\"flex gap-4 border-b border-rule py-3\"> <span class=\"font-mono text-[0.75rem] tabular-nums text-ink-soft\"> 04 </span> <span class=\"text-[0.9375rem]\">You approve the BAS in the portal.</span> </li>\n<li class=\"flex gap-4 border-b border-rule py-3\"> <span class=\"font-mono text-[0.75rem] tabular-nums text-ink-soft\"> 05 </span> <span class=\"text-[0.9375rem]\">We lodge it under our agent number and send you the payment details.</span> </li>\n</ol></div>\n</p></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"shell mt-16\">\n<div class=\"card p-6 bg-paper-sunk\">\n<h2 class=\"text-lg\">Monthly, quarterly or annual?</h2>\n<p class=\"mt-2 mb-0 max-w-3xl text-[0.9375rem]\">Most small businesses lodge quarterly. Turnover of $20 million or more means monthly. <a href=\"/tax-tips/bas-lodgement-frequency/\">How BAS lodgement frequency works</a>. If your books are not up to date, <a href=\"/services/bookkeeping/\">bookkeeping</a> covers the BAS as part of the monthly fee.</p>\n</p></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"shell mt-16\" id=\"start\">\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl\">Start it</h2>\n<p class=\"mt-2 mb-6 max-w-2xl text-[0.9375rem]\"> Tell us what you need and we will come back with a fixed fee and what we need from you. No obligation, and no charge for telling you that you don&#8217;t need this. </p>\n<div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3\"> <a href=\"/get-a-quote/\" class=\"btn\">Get a quote</a> <a href=\"/contact/\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\">Contact Us</a> </div>\n<p class=\"mt-3 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\"> Prefer to talk it through? Call 0407 179 179 and we will take the details over the phone. Please don&#8217;t include your tax file number either way — we ask for it securely once an accountant is working on your file. </p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"shell mt-12 mb-16\">\n<div class=\"card p-6\">\n<h2 class=\"text-lg\">Related services</h2>\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><a href=\"/services/gst-registration/\" class=\"btn btn-secondary text-sm\">GST registration</a> <a href=\"/services/bookkeeping/\" class=\"btn btn-secondary text-sm\">Bookkeeping</a> <a href=\"/services/company-annual-compliance/\" class=\"btn btn-secondary text-sm\">Company annual compliance</a></div>\n</p></div>\n</section>\n</div>\n<div hidden class=\"xyz-schema\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Service\",\"@id\":\"https://superblyladyec52fb18e8-stxdq.wpcomstaging.com/services/bas-gst-lodgement/#service\",\"name\":\"BAS & GST lodgement\",\"url\":\"https://superblyladyec52fb18e8-stxdq.wpcomstaging.com/services/bas-gst-lodgement/\",\"description\":\"Your BAS prepared from your books, checked by a registered tax agent and lodged on time: GST, PAYG withholding and instalments, for a fixed fee per quarter.\",\"provider\":{\"@id\":\"https://superblyladyec52fb18e8-stxdq.wpcomstaging.com/#organization\"},\"areaServed\":{\"@type\":\"Country\",\"name\":\"Australia\"}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"@id\":\"https://superblyladyec52fb18e8-stxdq.wpcomstaging.com/#organization\",\"name\":\"XYZ Accounting\",\"url\":\"https://superblyladyec52fb18e8-stxdq.wpcomstaging.com/\"}</script></div>\n"
